<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήχω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			42
		</span></i>, etc.: fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					4.4
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐψήχθην </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				53
			</span></i>, etc.; pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔψηγμαι </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				698
			</span></i>:—<i>rub down, curry</i> a horse, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				4.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.1
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stroke,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήχων δέρην μέτωπά τ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1567
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμάκῳ ἔψηχεν θηρὸς κάρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.164
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>scratch,</i> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				310a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rub down, wear away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψ. πέτρην χρόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.225
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήχεται [ ἡ πέτρα] διὰ τὴν πληγὴν τῶν
					κυμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					935a13
				</span></i>
			; metaph., of remembrance, <i>to be worn away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				450b3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph.,
				<i>scribble,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄδικα βιβλία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					86
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
